{"id":"decente","lemma":"decente","pos":"adj","rank":1997,"glosses":["decent (showing integrity and moral uprightness)","decent (good enough; okay)","clean, tidy"],"ipa":"/deˈθente/","forms":{"femininePlural":"decentes"},"examples":[{"text":"A ese lugar no va gente decente.","en":"No decent people go to that place.","words":[{"g":"to"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"place"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"okay"},{"g":"people"},null]},{"text":"No tengo un vestido decente para tal ocasión.","en":"I don't have a dress good enough for such an occasion.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/635538","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"dressed"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"such"},{"g":"occasion"}]},{"text":"Creo que son personas decentes.","en":"I think they're honest people.","words":[{"g":"to believe","l":"creer"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"person (an individual","l":"persona"},null]},{"text":"Tomás es un hombre decente.","en":"Tom is a decent guy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/455223","words":[{"g":"to take","l":"tomar"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"man"},null]},{"text":"Consíguete un traje decente.","en":"Get yourself a decent suit.","words":[{"g":"to achieve","l":"conseguir"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"suit"},null]}]}